<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Word of promise, real within me,</l><l>Life divine now freeing me—</l><l>From sin’s cruel control releasing,</l><l>From death’s power setting free.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Deepest springs of life dispensing,</l><l>Like the hart I thirst for Thee;</l><l>Desp’rate, may I drink Thy fullness</l><l>Till Thy river flows through me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>May my self be put to death, Lord,</l><l>Under Thy control I’d be.</l><l>Transformed to Thy living image,</l><l>I’d forever flow out Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
